sort [g asc, id asc]
└─ project (g, i, id, r)
   └─ project (x.g, x.i, x.id, x.r)
      └─ filter (== 3 w_0)
         └─ window partition=[big.g] order=[big.i desc nulls-last] fns=[w_0=rank]
            └─ filter (<= __topk_0__ 3)
               └─ window partial partition=[big.g] order=[big.i desc nulls-last] fns=[__topk_0__=rank]
